{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>石硤尾發生火警。昨晚（15日）10時30分左右，警方接報指，石硤尾邨美益樓樓下垃圾收集站冒煙起火，消防接報到場，同晚10時39分出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊，約4分鐘後、即是當晚10時43分將火撲熄。消防經調查後，相信有火種點燃上址被棄置傢俬，起火原因沒有可疑。事件中，無人受傷，約40人疏散。</p><p>事發時有網民目擊火警，「同個朋友喺附近吹吹下水突然火燭」，同時拍片上載至Threads。片中可見，上址火光熊熊，火勢和附近樹木極近，消防到場開喉射水灌救，事後將火勢撲熄。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場射水撲火。（Threads@tszzchung__影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187586535847890944392108.jpeg/zgLnE3zmiw7uwIywaicIxWxQSs7Y1JwvhlF5qoZReao\"/><figcaption>消防到場射水撲火。（Threads@tszzchung__影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防撲熄火勢。（Threads@tszzchung__圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187586538221998080069542.jpeg/kMgUciUJ4K7Gv-g4qU5NfA2e9x_IiPjn2bbbCtm22wo\"/><figcaption>消防撲熄火勢。（Threads@tszzchung__圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.897473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T18:38:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:58:03.259500+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:52.208549+00:00","content_hash":"ac38746da983076a1581d36bd6f0a5fe2dba537205f13dcdecda7e3ff225f018","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}